Decide: drop 5.36/5.38 from the matrix (or Text::Nunjucks lowers its minimum); raise Skilletor minimum perl to 5.040 or not; until the CPAN release, install it in CI first, e.g. git clone --depth 1 https://github.com/Getty/p5-text-nunjucks /tmp/tn, cpanm -nq --installdeps /tmp/tn, PERL5LIB=/tmp/tn/lib for installdeps and prove (a dzil dist has no Makefile.PL, so a git-URL cpanm install likely fails). Once Text::Nunjucks is on CPAN the cpanfile pin covers it.

